OL,3,GNEWSA'I was at the pub - then my wife's
OL,4,Ahandbag exploded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is warning about the dangers of
OL,7,F"unbranded" batteries after his wife's
OL,8,Fspare ones for her vape blew up "like a
OL,9,Ffirework".
OL,11,FDusty Sheppard said he was outside a
OL,12,Fpub in Gomshall in Surrey on Friday
OL,13,Fwhen "all of a sudden flames flew out"
OL,14,Fof his wife's handbag.
OL,16,F"It [was] like someone holding a Roman
OL,17,Fcandle," he told the BBC.
OL,19,F"She felt the heat against her leg,
OL,20,Fthrew her bag off and ran away like
OL,21,Feverybody else. [Her] reactions were
OL,22,Fvery good."
